## Why This Is Asked
Ensures robust observability, tenant isolation, and safe release discipline for production ML services.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant drift detection across model_versions
- Canary rollout and rollback criteria
- Data residency and privacy considerations
- Drift metrics schema and reporting
- Synthetic drift testing and alerting

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo drift score computation between old and new distributions
function computeDrift(oldDist, newDist){ 
  let drift = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < oldDist.length; i++){
    let p = oldDist[i] || 1e-9;
    let q = newDist[i] || 1e-9;
    drift += p * Math.log(p / q);
  }
  return drift;
}
```

